    "about": "The Golden Globe Awards honour the best in both film and television at a glamorous January ceremony in Beverly Hills, traditionally seen as an early bellwether for the Oscars. Known for their loose, champagne-fuelled atmosphere, the Globes are one of Hollywood's most-watched award shows.",
    "nextEvent": "The next Golden Globe Awards are held in January at the Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills. Uniquely, they reward film and television side by side, making the ceremony an early signpost of the awards season to come.",
